  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\" style=\"height:auto\"><div class=\"kanso-markdown\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-markdown__block\"><div class=\"kanso-markdown__heading\">Rate limits</div></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-markdown__block\"><p>Each customer gets a bucket of requests. A request takes one token; the bucket refills one token every 2 s.</p></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-markdown__block kanso-row--hover\"><table class=\"kanso-markdown__table\"><tr><th>Plan</th><th>Per minute</th><th>Burst</th></tr><tr><td>Free</td><td>40</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Pro</td><td>400</td><td>60</td></tr></table></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-markdown__block\"><div class=\"kanso-markdown__subheading\">Retry-After</div></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-markdown__block\"><p>An empty bucket answers <code>429</code> with <code>Retry-After</code> in seconds.</p></div>\n              </div></div></div></div>"
